{"resourceIdentifier":"572","resourceName":"Dalian Maoyingzi Landfill Gas Recovery for Power Generation Project","description":"Maoyingzi landfill is the main municipal-solid-waste (MSW) disposal place of Dalian city in the northeast China,with the daily capacity of receiving 2300 tons waste. There was a large amount of landfill gas (LFG) produced by the decomposition of organic MSW materials in the landfill which is not collected and just vented directly to atmosphere, the un-controlled LFG release impact negatively on the health of the local population by the nauseous odors from the site and lease to risks of flammable and explosive threat on the landfill site. Dalian Maoyingzi LFG Project is a typical application for renewable energy utilization and GHG reduction, which was constructed in two stages, the first stage is to build landfill gas recovery system for flaring, and the second stage is to build LFG power generation station with designed capacity up to 4MW. The negative impact and risks of landfill gas release has been greatly reduced by implementation of Project Activity.","location":{"latitude":39.080556,"longitude":121.655556},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"572"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Liaoning"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Dalian PhasCon Technologies Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Istanbul, Turkey"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Late to verify"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"572"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"241053"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_